flowchart TD
    M[Approved schema-v3 cleanup manifest]
    P[Fresh cleanup preflight receipt]
    S[Immutable evidence roots and trust pins]
    V[Replay complete preflight]
    T{Receipt still active?}
    B[Build canonical action plan]
    O[Order exact targets by safe stage]
    E[Bind typed outcome and evidence requirements]
    R[Independent plan replay]
    X[Reject and recapture]
    A[[Separately authorized manual operator boundary]]
    L[Outcome bundle and operator timeline]

    M --> V
    P --> V
    S --> V
    V --> T
    T -- No --> X
    T -- Yes --> B
    B --> O
    O --> E
    E --> R
    R --> T
    R --> A
    A --> L

    N[No commands, executor, process access, package access, credential access, or deletion]
    N -. constrains .-> B
    N -. constrains .-> R
